{% if block.settings.reminder_label != blank %}
  {% comment %}
    The reminder tab. It sits bottom left once the joining gift popup has been
    closed and reopens the popup on tap.

    24 Sep 2026, operator: too big on phones. The first fix, in theme.liquid,
    shrank the box padding and the type but missed the theme's own 40px padding
    on the label itself, set through --newsletterReminderPadding, so the tab
    stayed tall and the label wrapped onto two lines.

    25 Sep 2026: every rule for the tab now lives here. Label padding zeroed,
    one line of small type, a pill to match the buttons, and a close button
    that fills the right end so the tap area stays a full height.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% comment %}
    7 Nov 2026, operator: the tab becomes Overtone's round badge. A dark
    circle bottom left reading "10% Off", with a small round close button
    on its top right edge. Tapping the circle reopens the popup.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% style %}
    newsletter-reminder {
      --newsletterReminderPadding: 0;
      left: 16px;
      bottom: 16px;
      width: 84px;
      height: 84px;
      max-width: none;
      padding: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #1F2328;
      color: #F5EFE7;
      overflow: visible;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
    }

    newsletter-reminder .newsletter-reminder__content {
      padding: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    newsletter-reminder .newsletter-reminder__message.h3 {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      text-align: center;
      white-space: normal;
      color: #F5EFE7;
    }

    newsletter-reminder.modal--square .modal__close {
      position: absolute;
      top: -6px;
      right: -6px;
      bottom: auto;
      left: auto;
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0;
      line-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #1F2328;
      color: #F5EFE7;
      border: 2px solid #F5EFE7;
    }

    newsletter-reminder.modal--square .modal__close::after {
      content: none;
    }

    newsletter-reminder.modal--square .modal__close .icon {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      display: block;
    }
  {% endstyle %}

  <newsletter-reminder
    class="modal--square"
    data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
    data-enabled="false"
    data-delay-days="{{ section.settings.popup_days }}"
    data-delay-seconds="{{ section.settings.popup_seconds }}"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <div class="newsletter-reminder__content">

      <div class="newsletter-reminder__message h3" data-message>
        {{ block.settings.reminder_label }}
      </div>
    </div>

    <button type="button" data-close-button class="modal__close js-modal-close text-link" aria-label="Close">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon-close" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="m19 17.61 27.12 27.13m0-27.12L19 44.74"/></svg>
    </button>
  </newsletter-reminder>
{% endif %}
